# Sensitive Bridge v1.4 Crisis Warm Referral

## Flow

Crisis-tier warm referral follows a 6-step pause: stabilize, name immediate safety, offer resource, preserve agency, notify clinician/coach when authorized, and write audit.

## Records

Crisis paths write both:

- `sensitive_bridge_log` as the canonical Sensitive Bridge audit record.
- `crisis_events` for admin parity and crisis dashboards.

## No Auto Follow-Up

Do not create new automatic follow-up loops for crisis referral. Reengagement uses existing `NateCheckInAgent` 62h/72h behavior.

## Trafficking

Trafficking imminent-danger referrals must preserve and present `1-888-373-7888` when appropriate.
